  {
   "id": "title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -120,
   "width": 2580,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# 5b — Chỉnh 1 thông số vật liệu (U2 Interactive Edit Session)\nNguồn: [[Architecture_Map]] Phần 5 (tự sinh, đừng sửa tay). **Đi theo mũi tên 1 → 2 → 3… = đi theo thời gian.** Mũi tên **xanh lá + ✓K2** = đã kiểm chứng K2 · **xám** = theo doc · **đỏ + ?** = chưa rõ. Dòng nhỏ cuối thẻ = ai gọi. Thẻ vàng = nhánh ngược lại / ghi chú."
  },
  {
   "id": "h_U",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 25,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### User"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_ROW",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[WBP_ParamScalarRow]]",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_INV",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[WBP_FurnitureInventory]]",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_UM",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[BP_UndoManager]]",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_SM",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[BP_FurnitureSceneManager]]",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_MSS",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[MaterialSlotService_Reference]]",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 280,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 102,
   "text": "**1.** nhấn slider\n<small>← User · thao tác người dùng</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 422,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 146,
   "text": "**2.** báo tin\n`OnEditBegin(ParamName) → Handle_ScalarBegin`\n<small>← WBP_ParamScalarRow · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 608,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 256,
   "text": "**3.** mở phiên\n`BeginInteractiveEdit()`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#BeginInteractiveEdit(EntityID, SlotName, HintIndex, ParamName, Type) — Custom Event (v1.21, U2.4) — ** ✓K2 export 24/09/2026, sau khi dọn Print **|BP_UndoManager › BeginInteractiveEdit]]\n<small>← WBP_FurnitureInventory · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 904,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**4.** tìm ghế theo ID\n`ResolveByPersistentId()`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureSceneManager#ResolveByPersistentId(Id String) → (OutActor BP_FurnitureActor, bFound Bool)|BP_FurnitureSceneManager › ResolveByPersistentId]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 1134,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "**5.** đọc Before từ mesh\n`GetSlotScalarParam() → cất Sess_Cmd`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#GetSlotScalarParam / GetSlotVectorParam(Mesh, SlotName, HintIndex, ParamName, OutValue&) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › GetSlotScalarParam]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 1386,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 124,
   "text": "↻ lặp: mỗi khấc kéo\n**6.** kéo\n<small>← User · thao tác người dùng</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 1550,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 146,
   "text": "↻ lặp: mỗi khấc kéo\n**7.** báo tin\n`OnPreviewChanged(ParamName, Value)`\n<small>← WBP_ParamScalarRow · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 1736,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 278,
   "text": "↻ lặp: mỗi khấc kéo\n**8.** áp live, KHÔNG ghi sổ\n`SetSlotScalarParam()`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#SetSlotScalarParam / SetSlotVectorParam / SetSlotTextureParam(Mesh, Records&, SlotName, HintIndex, ParamName, Value) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › SetSlotScalarParam]]\n<small>← WBP_FurnitureInventory · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 2054,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 146,
   "text": "▸ nếu thả tay\n**9.** báo tin\n`OnEditCommitted → Handle_ScalarCommit`\n<small>← WBP_ParamScalarRow · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 2240,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 256,
   "text": "▸ nếu thả tay\n**10.** chốt phiên\n`CommitInteractiveEdit()`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#CommitInteractiveEdit() — Custom Event (v1.21, U2.4 build / U2.5 nối UI) — ** ✓K2 export 24/09/2026, sau khi dọn Print **|BP_UndoManager › CommitInteractiveEdit]]\n<small>← WBP_FurnitureInventory · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 2536,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 234,
   "text": "▸ nếu thả tay\n**11.** đọc After\n`GetSlotScalarParam()`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#GetSlotScalarParam / GetSlotVectorParam(Mesh, SlotName, HintIndex, ParamName, OutValue&) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › GetSlotScalarParam]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 2810,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "▸ nếu thả tay\n**12.** After khác Before → BuildSceneSnapshotBase() + AppendEntry() = 1 entry\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#BuildSceneSnapshotBase(ActionName) → S_SceneSnapshot — Function MỚI (U2.3, 24/09/2026)|BP_UndoManager › BuildSceneSnapshotBase]]\n<small>nội bộ · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 3062,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 256,
   "text": "▸ nếu thả tay\n**13.** báo tin\n`Broadcast OnHistoryChanged → RefreshParamPanel()`\n↗ [[WBP_FurnitureInventory#`RefreshParamPanel()` — Function — AS-BUILT ĐẦY ĐỦ 18/09/2026 (K2Node export thật)|WBP_FurnitureInventory › RefreshParamPanel]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 3358,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 256,
   "text": "▸ ngược lại: hủy giữa chừng (đổi ghế · đổi slot · đóng panel · Ctrl+Z)\n**14.** hủy phiên\n`CancelInteractiveEdit()`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#CancelInteractiveEdit() — Custom Event (v1.21, U2.4) — 6A của session|BP_UndoManager › CancelInteractiveEdit]]\n<small>← WBP_FurnitureInventory · theo doc</small>",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 3654,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 322,
   "text": "▸ ngược lại: hủy giữa chừng (đổi ghế · đổi slot · đóng panel · Ctrl+Z)\n**15.** về Before, 0 entry\n`ApplyParamCommand() → SetSlotScalarParam()`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#SetSlotScalarParam / SetSlotVectorParam / SetSlotTextureParam(Mesh, Records&, SlotName, HintIndex, ParamName, Value) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › SetSlotScalarParam]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>",
   "color": "3"
  }
 ],
